"""Actual immutable semantic reference→surface→UV→export trials."""
import hashlib,json,shutil,subprocess,time
from pathlib import Path
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1];QA=ROOT/'data/semantic-upgrade-20261014'

def run(command,log):
    with log.open('w',encoding='utf-8') as stream:subprocess.run(command,cwd=ROOT,stdout=stream,stderr=subprocess.STDOUT,check=True)

def trial(name,source,reference,source_crop,target_crop,source_box,target_box,classes):
    folder=QA/name;folder.mkdir(exist_ok=False);analysis=folder/'analysis';view=analysis/'views/front';view.mkdir(parents=True);shutil.copy2(reference,view/'source.png');digest=hashlib.sha256(source.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
    settings={'front_axis':'negative_y','views':{'front':{'profile':'anime','source_crop':source_crop,'target_crop':target_crop,'registration':{'source_box':source_box,'target_box':target_box,'target_polygon':[[0,0],[1,0],[1,1],[0,1]],'minimum_cosine':.5,'accept_unknown_target':False}}}}
    (analysis/'options.json').write_text(json.dumps(settings),encoding='utf-8');started=time.perf_counter();run([str(ROOT/'.venv-hair/Scripts/python.exe'),str(ROOT/'backend/texture_engine/semantic_cli.py'),'--mode','analysis','--input',str(source),'--output',str(analysis),'--options',str(analysis/'options.json')],analysis/'process.log');analysis_seconds=time.perf_counter()-started;record=json.loads((analysis/'semantic_analysis.json').read_text());assert record['status']=='reviewable',record.get('reason') or record.get('atlas_reason')
    result=folder/'result';result.mkdir();options={'provider':'semantic_reference','analysis_id':'a'*32,'front_axis':'negative_y','classes':classes,'protected_classes':[],'reviewed_alignment':True,'intensity':1,'completion':'preserve','seam_correction':True};(result/'options.json').write_text(json.dumps(options),encoding='utf-8');started=time.perf_counter();run([str(ROOT/'.venv-texture/Scripts/python.exe'),str(ROOT/'backend/texture_engine/semantic_cli.py'),'--mode','paint','--input',str(source),'--output',str(result),'--options',str(result/'options.json'),'--analysis',str(analysis)],result/'process.log');paint_seconds=time.perf_counter()-started;report=json.loads((result/'texture.json').read_text());assert report['geometry']['equivalent'] and report['semantic']['protected_pixels_equal'] and report['semantic']['changed_pixels']>0
    run([str(ROOT/'tools/blender-4.5.3-windows-x64/blender.exe'),'--background','--factory-startup','--disable-autoexec','--threads','6','--python-exit-code','1','--python',str(ROOT/'blender/pipeline.py'),'--','--input',str(result/'model.glb'),'--output',str(result),'--mode','export','--options',str(result/'options.json')],result/'export.log');run([str(ROOT/'.venv-ai/Scripts/python.exe'),str(ROOT/'backend/texture_engine/validate_export.py'),'--source',str(source),'--directory',str(result)],result/'validate-export.log');assert hashlib.sha256(source.read_bytes()).hexdigest()==digest
    summary={'name':name,'source':str(source.relative_to(ROOT)),'reference':str(reference.relative_to(ROOT)),'analysis_seconds':round(analysis_seconds,3),'paint_wall_seconds':round(paint_seconds,3),'semantic':report['semantic'],'exports':json.loads((result/'geometry_export_validation.json').read_text())};(folder/'measured.json').write_text(json.dumps(summary,indent=2),encoding='utf-8');print('REAL_SEMANTIC_CASE_PASS',name,json.dumps({k:report['semantic'][k] for k in ['changed_pixels','blocked_cross_class_texels','metrics']}),flush=True)

